		{"id":"history-core","type":"text","x":60,"y":80,"width":600,"height":280,"text":"# Sprint 01–14\n\nСозданы инфраструктура, auth, organizations, Objects, Risks, Trust Passport, Trust Score, Graph, Dashboard, security hardening, UX, reporting, import, explainability, risk workflow и pilot readiness.","color":"4"},
		{"id":"history-connectors","type":"text","x":60,"y":420,"width":600,"height":230,"text":"# Sprint 15\n\nConnector Framework Foundation завершён как архитектурный и security contract. Runtime и первый connector отложены до подтверждённого спроса.","color":"4"},
