		{"id":"gate-result","type":"text","x":880,"y":430,"width":600,"height":220,"text":"# Условие выхода\n\nSEC-01–04 и STAB-01–05 закрыты; migration parity подтверждён; RLS integration matrix, authenticated QA и regression имеют фактический PASS.","color":"1"},
