		{"id":"business-sprints","type":"text","x":2620,"y":80,"width":700,"height":480,"text":"# Sprint 20–24\n\n**20:** Connector Runtime & Discovery Inbox\n\n**21:** Первый подтверждённый source и infrastructure discovery\n\n**22:** Evidence-backed findings и Trust impact\n\n**23:** Dependencies, exposure paths, SPOF и resilience\n\n**24:** Remediation workflow и pilot release","color":"4"},
